{
  "declaredLength": 2288,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "只要和密阿雷的厨师们聊天，\n你的名字就会成为话题……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n吉普索，你究竟是何方神圣？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981548C5BC6963F96F7768453A85E084EEC804A5929FF0C000A4F607684540D5B575C314F1A62104E3A8BDD98982026202600100001BE00000A5409666E7D22FF0C4F607A767ADF662F4F5565B9795E5723FF1F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我只是个在密阿雷\n长大的小混混。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EA662F4E2A57285BC6963F96F7000A957F592776845C0F6DF76DF7300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "食物吃下去就会消失，有位厨师仍要\n不辞辛劳地把它们做得更美味。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n通过和这位厨师相遇……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "98DF726954034E0B53BB5C314F1A6D885931FF0C67094F4D53A85E084ECD8981000A4E0D8F9E8F9B52B35730628A5B834EEC505A5F9766F47F8E5473300200100001BE00000A901A8FC7548C8FD94F4D53A85E0876F890472026202600100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我开始变得全心全意面对烹饪了。\n仅此而已。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115F0059CB53D85F9751685FC35168610F97625BF970F9996A4E863002000A4EC56B64800C5DF2300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且说到讲究，\n你也有自己的追求不是吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n你烤可颂的火候，撒盐的拿捏，\n都是最高水准。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E148BF452308BB27A76FF0C000A4F604E5F670981EA5DF176848FFD6C424E0D662F5417FF1F00100001BE01000A4F6070E453EF98827684706B5019FF0C649276D0768462FF634FFF0C000A90FD662F67009AD86C3451C6300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "烹饪是科学。\n只要遵守数字和步骤，就不会失败。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70F9996A662F79D15B663002000A53EA898190755B8865705B57548C6B659AA4FF0C5C314E0D4F1A59318D25300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且我已经锻炼得能以1度为单位\n调整宝可梦的火属性招式了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E1462115DF27ECF953B70BC5F9780FD4EE500315EA64E3A53554F4D000A8C0365745B9D53EF68A67684706B5C5E602762DB5F0F4E86300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "厉害！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n很明显，你是靠这身本领\n才成为这么强的训练家的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53895BB3FF0100100001BE01000A5F88660E663EFF0C4F60662F97608FD98EAB672C9886000A624D62104E3A8FD94E485F3A76848BAD7EC35BB67684300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没错！\n火力在对战上也是一个重要的要素。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA19519FF01000A706B529B57285BF962184E0A4E5F662F4E004E2A91CD8981768489817D20300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对吃的东西太过讲究，\n这多麻烦呀。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF9540376844E1C897F592A8FC78BB27A76FF0C000A8FD9591A9EBB70E65440300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好好工作后吃饭的话，\n还不是吃什么都香？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D597D5DE54F5C540E5403996D76848BDDFF0C000A8FD84E0D662F54034EC04E4890FD9999FF1F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "古丽兹！\n你能和我一起战斗吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E44E3D5179FF01000A4F6080FD548C62114E008D77621865975417FF1F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "行啊，反正在对战中活动活动，\n之后也是吃什么都香。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "884C554AFF0C53CD6B6357285BF962184E2D6D3B52A86D3B52A8FF0C000A4E4B540E4E5F662F54034EC04E4890FD9999300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请你和我一起战斗吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF74F60548C62114E008D77621865975427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然可以",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F53713653EF4EE50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会在对战场等你的，\n麻烦你来找我。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A57285BF96218573A7B494F607684FF0C000A9EBB70E64F606765627E6211300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "希望我们能打出一场\n充满刺激的对战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E0C671B62114EEC80FD625351FA4E00573A000A51456EE1523A6FC076845BF96218300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了让吉普索体会我有多感动，\n我想打宝可梦对战！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E868BA95409666E7D224F534F1A62116709591A611F52A8FF0C000A621160F362535B9D53EF68A65BF96218FF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "陪我们打场对战吧！\n这也是为了古历。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "966A62114EEC6253573A5BF962185427FF01000A8FD94E5F662F4E3A4E8653E45386300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会赢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A8D62FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不能一直烟雾缭绕，\n要熊熊燃烧才行！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D80FD4E0076F470DF96FE7F2D7ED5FF0C000A8981718A718A71C370E7624D884CFF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喷火龙啊，喷出黑暗的火焰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B7706B9F99554AFF0C55B751FA9ED166977684706B71305427FF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那你想干什么啊……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34F6060F35E724EC04E48554A2026202600100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会烧掉你的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A70E763894F607684FF0100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜托你了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC62584F604E86300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了能让燃尽时的光芒闪耀夺目，\n就用超级进化来肆意燃烧吧，喷火龙！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E8680FD8BA971C35C3D65F676845149829295EA8000593A76EEFF0C000A5C3175288D857EA78FDB531667658086610F71C370E75427FF0C55B7706B9F99FF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了能作为新咖啡的一员重获新生，\n我要让你看看燃烧生命的超级进化！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E8680FD4F5C4E3A65B05496556176844E00545891CD83B765B0751FFF0C000A621189818BA94F60770B770B71C370E7751F547D76848D857EA78FDB5316FF0100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "盔甲鸟，拜托你了。\n让我当一个堂堂的男子汉吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76D475329E1FFF0C62DC62584F604E863002000A8BA962115F534E004E2A58025802768475375B506C495427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我虽然输了，但也让吉普索\n见识了我那燃烧的灵魂有多厉害。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211867D71368F934E86FF0C4F464E5F8BA95409666E7D22000A89C18BC64E86621190A371C370E7768470759B426709591A53895BB3300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在我的心中，\n正熊熊燃起一团厨师之火。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5728621176845FC34E2DFF0C000A6B63718A718A71C38D774E0056E253A85E084E4B706B300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好了，\n谢谢你陪我们对战，这是谢礼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D4E86FF0C000A8C228C224F60966A62114EEC5BF96218FF0C8FD9662F8C22793C300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>获得了另一种颜色的\n古历装扮厨师套装！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000083B75F974E8653E64E0079CD989C82727684000A53E4538688C5626E53A85E08595788C5FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "古历那样的发型\n好像也不错啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E4538690A36837768453D1578B000A597D50CF4E5F4E0D9519554A300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一场美好的邂逅会引导人\n往正确的方向前进……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00573A7F8E597D7684908290054F1A5F155BFC4EBA000A5F806B63786E768465B95411524D8FDB2026202600100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想在烹饪和对战上\n都登峰造极！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F3572870F9996A548C5BF962184E0A000A90FD767B5CF090206781FF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我现在吃什么都香啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621173B0572854034EC04E4890FD9999554A300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟活着就是要吃嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF6D3B77405C31662F89815403561B300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    }
  ],
